<title>USA: Dean Witter says no decision on layoffs.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter says no decision on layoffs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co said Friday it has made no decisions on layoffs and that any that might occur will be minimal.</p>
<p>In a statement, the brokerage said, &quot;We are now in the transition period during which we're determining how best to link Dean Witter's distribution with Morgan Stanley's origination.</p>
<p>&quot;We plan to be the market leader and the watchword is 'growth', not 'redundancy',&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
